"quoted"}], "text": "First for in vivo prime editing but in vivo knockout and base editing at dna lvl has been done many times/for years now… https://t.co/tzTtwf7kGG", "url": "https://x.com/dshahh/status/2113682797588086933"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113408100162035712"]}, "author_id": "2060252048965451776", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:12:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113408102645022898"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/j7QdtTMe10", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/exfilnews/status/2113408102645022898/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113408100162035712", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/j7QdtTMe10"}]}, "id": "2113408102645022898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 240, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime editing was first described in Nature in October 2019. Seven years on, Prime Medicine says it has used it inside a person for the first time, rewriting liver DNA in a Wilson disease trial. Per Nature, base editing can't fix the commonest ATP7B mutations. Results due 2027. https://t.co/j7QdtTMe10", "url": "https://x.com/exfilnews/status/2113408102645022898"}, {"author_id": "4323361101", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:04:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113451459974946914"], "id": "2113451459974946914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 637, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "￼The method called prime editing can make fine-scale edits to DNA 🧬 \n\nA powerful gene-editing technique has been used to edit DNA directly in a person’s body — the first known instance of such a treatment.\n\nA first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the", "url": "https://x.com/DocpalFrancesc2/status/2113451459974946914"}, {"author_id": "167121831", "created_at": "2026-10-24T16:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114031903171023196"], "entities": {"urls": [{"descri